            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nTo get the most out of this lesson, we recommend reading these texts first:\n\n- **Where are we on a sphere?**: how a point on a sphere is located with spherical coordinates, a radius and two angles (<htcite0>)\n- **Surface Coordinates**: how those coordinates become latitude and longitude, measured from the Equator and the Greenwich Meridian (<htcite1>)",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "0dd6b53f-ea68-475d-9b18-99d38a428c0a",
                     "text": "History Tracers Atlas",
                     "page": "Where are we on a sphere?",
                     "date_time": {
